<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Open Notes – Graphics</title><link>https://nagarajrpoojari.github.io/opennotes/categories/graphics/</link><description>Recent content in Graphics on Open Notes</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 15 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0530</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://nagarajrpoojari.github.io/opennotes/categories/graphics/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Owl: 3D Graphics Engine &amp; Real-Time Ray Tracer</title><link>https://nagarajrpoojari.github.io/opennotes/projects/owl/</link><pubDate>Sat, 15 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0530</pubDate><guid>https://nagarajrpoojari.github.io/opennotes/projects/owl/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/nagarajpoojari404/owl" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;View on GitHub&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="#key-features"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="#building--running"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building &amp;amp; Running&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owl&lt;/strong&gt; is a high-level 3D graphics and real-time rendering engine written from scratch using C++, modern OpenGL, and GLSL shaders. Built to explore low-level rendering pipelines, ray-object intersection mathematics, lighting models, and physics simulations, Owl delivers real-time ray tracing alongside interactive 3D scene manipulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="architectural-overview"&gt;Architectural Overview&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="architectural-overview"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#architectural-overview" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div role="img" aria-label="Diagram"&gt;
&lt;pre class="mermaid hx:mt-6"&gt;
flowchart TD
Scene[&amp;#34;Scene Graph (Entities &amp;amp; Components)&amp;#34;] --&amp;gt; Pipeline[&amp;#34;Rendering Pipeline&amp;#34;]
subgraph Graphics[&amp;#34;Rendering Core&amp;#34;]
Pipeline --&amp;gt; Shaders[&amp;#34;GLSL Vertex &amp;amp; Fragment Shaders&amp;#34;]
Pipeline --&amp;gt; RayTracer[&amp;#34;Real-Time Ray Tracing Core&amp;#34;]
RayTracer --&amp;gt; BVH[&amp;#34;Bounding Volume Hierarchy (BVH)&amp;#34;]
RayTracer --&amp;gt; Light[&amp;#34;Phong Shading &amp;amp; Shadow Rays&amp;#34;]
end
subgraph Physics[&amp;#34;Physics Engine&amp;#34;]
RigidBody[&amp;#34;Rigid Body Dynamics&amp;#34;]
Gravity[&amp;#34;Gravity Simulation&amp;#34;]
Collision[&amp;#34;Collision Detection &amp;amp; Resolution&amp;#34;]
RigidBody --&amp;gt; Gravity --&amp;gt; Collision
end
Collision --&amp;gt; Scene
Light --&amp;gt; Framebuffer[&amp;#34;OpenGL Framebuffer / Display&amp;#34;]
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="key-features"&gt;Key Features&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="key-features"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#key-features" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="1-real-time-ray-tracing"&gt;1. Real-Time Ray Tracing&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="1-real-time-ray-tracing"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#1-real-time-ray-tracing" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implements ray generation from virtual camera perspective through screen pixels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exact analytical ray-primitive intersection tests for spheres, planes, triangles, and bounding boxes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recursive reflection and refraction calculations for dielectric and metallic surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soft shadow generation and ambient occlusion approximations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="2-physics-simulation-engine"&gt;2. Physics Simulation Engine&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="2-physics-simulation-engine"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#2-physics-simulation-engine" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrated rigid-body kinematics with constant gravitational acceleration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elastic and inelastic impulse-based collision response between dynamic objects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous spatial partitioning to accelerate multi-body collision queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="3-shader-pipeline--materials"&gt;3. Shader Pipeline &amp;amp; Materials&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="3-shader-pipeline--materials"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#3-shader-pipeline--materials" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Custom GLSL vertex, fragment, and compute shaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support for diffuse, specular, normal mapping, and reflection maps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configurable point lights, directional lights, and ambient illumination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="4-interactive-camera--controls"&gt;4. Interactive Camera &amp;amp; Controls&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="4-interactive-camera--controls"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#4-interactive-camera--controls" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First-person 6-DOF (degree-of-freedom) Euler angle camera controller.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Smooth mouse look and keyboard navigation across 3D scenes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="building--running"&gt;Building &amp;amp; Running&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="building--running"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#building--running" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="prerequisites"&gt;Prerequisites&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="prerequisites"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#prerequisites" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;C++17 or higher&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CMake / Make&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OpenGL 3.3+ Core Profile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GLFW / GLEW / GLM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Clone the repository&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;git clone https://github.com/nagarajpoojari404/owl.git
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; owl
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Compile the engine&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;make build
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Run the 3D engine demo&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;./bin/owl_engine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
